--- PATH RECONCILIATION (no silent drift, Honesty Covenant #9) ---------------
The generated prompt's templated Output path
`apps/apple/TeslaSync/Features/Driving/SpeedProfilePage.swift` is NOT a source
root in apps/apple/project.yml. The TeslaSync (iOS) + TeslaSync-macOS targets
compile `TeslaSync/feature-views/` (flat), `TeslaSync/dashboard-widgets/`,
`Sources/`, `Localization/`, and `../design/generated/apple`. All 171 existing
peer surfaces (e.g. DrivingTab, BatteryTab, DriveAnalyticsSection) live in
`TeslaSync/feature-views/` using the multi-file pattern
(X.swift / X.Model.swift / X.Adapter.swift / X.Models.swift / X.Views.swift /
X.States.swift / X.Charts.swift / X.strings / X.Previews.swift / X.Tests.swift).
Placing files at the templated path would compile NOTHING (dead code). The
surface is therefore implemented at the real, compiled location
`apps/apple/TeslaSync/feature-views/SpeedProfilePage.*`, matching every peer.

